1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,100
Kamu di Bulan, butuh suku cadang.

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,420
Sampah kemasan bisa membantu?

3
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,325
Kita ikuti konsep CERBERUZ,

4
